================================================================================
WHAT THIS LICENCE COVERS, AND WHAT IT DOES NOT
================================================================================

COVERED — the code and the writing about the code:

    scripts/            the pipeline
    functions/          the Cloudflare Worker
    docs/               ARCHIVE-REPORT.md, METHOD.md
    essay/, findings/   the essay and the analysis notes
    data/               the derived data tier (metadata, index, analyses)

NOT COVERED — the recovered articles:

    articles/           1,903 recovered NFL.com articles
    reader/             a built reader with those article bodies embedded
    dist-private/       the gated body payload

The article text is copyright NFL Enterprises LLC and the individual writers.
It is not the authors' to license and no permission to use it is granted or
implied here.

Those directories are not distributed with this repository. They are rebuilt
locally from the Internet Archive by the pipeline in scripts/, and they are
excluded from version control in .gitignore. If you obtain them by running the
pipeline, your use of them is a matter between you and the rights holders.

data/metadata.json deliberately excludes article bodies and deks. Titles,
bylines, dates and entity names are retained as bibliographic metadata. The
essay quotes six phrases totalling 32 words, each under fifteen words and each
attributed; see the quotation audit in the build.
